  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eastern Neighbourhood Small Projects Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will provide the mechanism for embassies to develop small projects to further the aims of the Country Business Plans and develop learning to support wider programming initiatives, with the overall aims of supporting development in the region. This is part of the FCDO&#x2019;s official development assistance and falls under the OECD DAC ODA rules.</narrative>
  </description>
